<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>DIGIY RÉSEAU · Lexique Wolof</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{
  background:#f2f2ef;
  font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;
  padding-bottom:2.5rem;
}
.header{
  background:#5a1a8a;
  color:#fff;
  padding:1.4rem 1.2rem 1.2rem;
  position:sticky;
  top:0;
  z-index:10;
}
.header-row{
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:12px;
}
.emoji{font-size:34px;line-height:1;}
.module-name{
  font-size:26px;
  font-weight:900;
  letter-spacing:-0.02em;
  line-height:1;
}
.module-sub{
  font-size:14px;
  opacity:0.82;
  margin-top:4px;
  font-weight:400;
}
.badge{
  margin-left:auto;
  background:#F6C453;
  color:#1a0a00;
  font-size:11px;
  font-weight:900;
  padding:5px 11px;
  border-radius:30px;
  white-space:nowrap;
  flex-shrink:0;
}
.cards{
  display:flex;
  flex-direction:column;
  gap:10px;
  padding:14px 12px;
}
.card{
  background:#fff;
  border-radius:16px;
  padding:18px 18px 16px;
  border-left:5px solid #5a1a8a;
}
.situation{
  font-size:12px;
  font-weight:900;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  letter-spacing:0.08em;
  color:#5a1a8a;
  margin-bottom:10px;
}
.fr{
  font-size:17px;
  font-weight:400;
  color:#222;
  margin-bottom:10px;
  line-height:1.4;
}
.wo{
  font-size:22px;
  font-weight:900;
  color:#5a1a8a;
  line-height:1.35;
}
.footer{
  margin:0 12px;
  padding:14px 18px;
  background:#5a1a8a;
  border-radius:16px;
  color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
  font-size:13px;
  text-align:center;
  line-height:1.7;
}
.footer strong{color:#fff;font-weight:900;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header">
  <div class="header-row">
    <span class="emoji">📣</span>
    <div>
      <div class="module-name">DIGIY RÉSEAU</div>
      <div class="module-sub">Visibilité · Communauté DIGIY</div>
    </div>
    <span class="badge">🇸🇳 Wolof</span>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="cards">
  <div class="card">
    <div class="situation">Rejoindre</div>
    <div class="fr">🇫🇷 Rejoignez le réseau DIGIY</div>
    <div class="wo">🇸🇳 Ñëw bokk ci DIGIY réseau bi</div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="situation">Fiche en ligne</div>
    <div class="fr">🇫🇷 Votre fiche est en ligne</div>
    <div class="wo">🇸🇳 Sa xibaar liggeey bi, dox na ci internet</div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="situation">QR code</div>
    <div class="fr">🇫🇷 Partagez votre QR code</div>
    <div class="wo">🇸🇳 Bokk sa QR code bi</div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="situation">Contact direct</div>
    <div class="fr">🇫🇷 Le client vous contacte directement</div>
    <div class="wo">🇸🇳 Jëndkat bi, dafa la woo ci kanam</div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="situation">Annonce</div>
    <div class="fr">🇫🇷 Publiez votre annonce</div>
    <div class="wo">🇸🇳 Bind sa xibaar bi ci réseau bi</div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="situation">Visible</div>
    <div class="fr">🇫🇷 Vous êtes visible sur la Petite Côte</div>
    <div class="wo">🇸🇳 Lañu la gis ci Petite Côte</div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="situation">0% commission</div>
    <div class="fr">🇫🇷 DIGIY ne prend aucune commission</div>
    <div class="wo">🇸🇳 Commission amul — 0%</div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="situation">Mise à jour</div>
    <div class="fr">🇫🇷 Mettez à jour votre fiche</div>
    <div class="wo">🇸🇳 Soppi sa xibaar bi</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="footer">
  <strong>DIGIYLYFE · RÉSEAU</strong><br>
  0% commission · Contact direct · Pierre par pierre 🦅♾️
</div>
</body>
</html>
